# HelperHive AI Conversational Booking Screen
## Full Frontend + Backend Architecture Instructions

Build a premium AI-powered conversational service booking screen in Flutter.

The experience should feel like:
- ChatGPT
- Claude AI conversational UI
- Uber service booking
- Google Maps integration
- Modern AI-native marketplace

The application is NOT a traditional marketplace app.

The core experience is:
> AI conversational orchestration for local services.

---

# CORE UX PRINCIPLE

The chat NEVER ends.

The AI continuously:
- understands the request
- extracts booking information
- asks only missing questions
- searches nearby providers
- updates provider recommendations
- updates map pins
- manages booking flow

The AI acts like:
> a live intelligent booking assistant.

