# IMPORTANT AI BEHAVIOR

The AI should NEVER ask unnecessary questions.

The AI must dynamically detect:
- what information already exists
- what information is missing

Example:

User:
"Need a plumber in DHA tomorrow at 2 PM"

AI already has:
- service
- location
- time

Missing:
- exact address

AI asks ONLY:
"Which phase and street?"

NOT ALL QUESTIONS.

---

# REQUIRED BOOKING FIELDS

AI should collect:

Required:
- service type
- complete address
- date/time

Optional:
- issue description
- urgency
- issue images
- voice notes
- preferred provider

