# GLOBAL APP STATES

The app should manage these main states:

## 1. Conversation State

Stores:
- messages
- AI responses
- orchestration states
- provider card groups
- selected provider
- typing states

Example:

```dart
class ConversationState {
  List<Message> messages;
  bool aiTyping;
  bool searchingProviders;
  bool mapVisible;
}
2. Booking State

Stores extracted booking information.

Example:

class BookingState {
  String? service;
  String? area;
  String? phase;
  String? street;
  String? date;
  String? time;
  String? issueDescription;
  List<String>? images;
}

This state persists throughout the conversation.

3. Provider State

Stores:

nearby providers
selected provider
provider rankings
ETA information

Example:

class ProviderState {
  List<Provider> nearbyProviders;
  Provider? selectedProvider;
}
4. Map State

Controls:

visibility
pins
routes
selected provider pin
map style

Example:

class MapState {
  bool visible;
  List<MapPin> pins;
  Polyline? route;
  int selectedMapStyle;
}

IMPORTANT:
Map visibility = FALSE initially.

ONLY TRUE when:

providers exist
